<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Marubeni/Hoechst Schering venture - source.</title>
<headline>EU clears Marubeni/Hoechst Schering venture - source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared a joint venture between Japanese trading company Marubeni and Germany's Hoechst Schering AgrEvo GmbH, a European Union source said on Friday.</p>
<p>Under the deal, Marubeni and Hoechst Schering AgrEvo acquire joint control of the venture, to be called Marubeni AgrEvo Holding B.V.</p>
</text>
